---
title: "Writing in Keystatic"
date: "2026-10-14"
summary: "Where posts, projects and photos live in the CMS."
tone: "yellow"
draft: false
---

Posts live in the Posts collection, projects in Projects (each a list of slides made of blocks), and photographs in Gallery.

Publishing a post rebuilds the site; the post appears on the blog index, in the RSS feed, and as a place on the cosmos map if you map it there.
